{"headword":"קָצֶה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>end, extremity</strong>, only sg.: abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:4\" href=\"/Genesis.19.4\">Gn 19:4</a> + 3 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:21\" href=\"/Judges.6.21\">Ju 6:21</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָצֵ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:21\" href=\"/Genesis.47.21\">Gn 47:21</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">(םִ)קְצֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.2\">Ez 33:2</a> (sg.; Ges<sup>§ 93 ss</sup>); pl. (cstr.) supplied by <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצוֹת</span>, v. foll.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>end</em>, of staff <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:21\" href=\"/Judges.6.21\">Ju 6:21</a>, rod <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.27\">1 S 14:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:43\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.43\">43</a>, curtains <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:5\" href=\"/Exodus.26.5\">Ex 26:5</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:12\" href=\"/Exodus.36.12\">36:12</a> (P; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, קָצֶה\" href=\"/BDB,_קָצֶה\", dir=\"rtl\">קָצָה</a>); of conduit <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.3\">Is 7:3</a>, river, = <em>mouth</em> v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.18\">18</a> (prob.), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:5\" href=\"/Joshua.15.5\">Jos 15:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:19\" href=\"/Joshua.18.19\">18:19</a>; of field <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:9\" href=\"/Genesis.23.9\">Gn 23:9</a>, valley <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:8\" href=\"/Joshua.15.8\">Jos 15:8</a>, tribe v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:21\" href=\"/Joshua.15.21\">21</a>, sea v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:2\" href=\"/Joshua.15.2\">2</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:3\" href=\"/Numbers.34.3\">Nu 34:3</a> (all P); of territory <span dir=\"rtl\">(גְּבוּל)</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:16\" href=\"/Numbers.20.16\">Nu 20:16</a> (JE; just <em>without</em>), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:36\" href=\"/Numbers.22.36\">22:36</a> (E; just <em>within</em>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.9\">Ez 25:9</a> (al. sub <strong>3</strong>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִק׳ גְּבוּל־מִצְרַיִם וְעַד־קָצֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:21\" href=\"/Genesis.47.21\">Gn 47:21</a> (J); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־הַקּ׳ אֶל־הַקּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:28\" href=\"/Exodus.26.28\">Ex 26:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:33\" href=\"/Exodus.36.33\">36:33</a> (of side of tabern.); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְצֵה צָפ֫וֹנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.1\">Ez 48:1</a> <em>at the northern extremity</em>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִק׳ תֵימָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:1\" href=\"/Joshua.15.1\">Jos 15:1</a> (P); of earth, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִק׳ (הָ)אָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.26\">Is 5:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.6\">43:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:49\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.49\">Dt 28:49</a> (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרָחוֹק</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.10\">Is 42:10</a> + 4 times; + phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִק׳ (הָ)אָרֶץ וְעַד־ק׳ הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.8\">Dt 13:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:64\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.64\">28:64</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:33\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.33\">Je 25:33</a>, of land <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.12\">12:12</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.15\">Is 26:15</a>); of earth, abbrev. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־ק׳ הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.31\">25:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.20\">Is 48:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.6\">49:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:10\" href=\"/Psalms.46.10\">ψ 46:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל־ק׳ הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.11\">Is 62:11</a>; of earth, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּק׳־אָ֑רֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.24\">Pr 17:24</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּק׳ תֵּבֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:5\" href=\"/Psalms.19.5\">ψ 19:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִק׳ הַשָּׁמַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.5\">Is 13:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאֶרֶץ מֶרְחָק</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:7\" href=\"/Psalms.19.7\">ψ 19:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־קְצוֹתָם</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּק׳ הַשּׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 30:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.30.4\">Dt 30:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 1:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.1.9\">Ne 1:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִק׳ הַשּׁ׳ וְעַד־ק׳ הַשּׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.32\">Dt 4:32</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>border, outskirts</em>, of city <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.27\">1 S 9:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.2\">14:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:19\" href=\"/Joshua.4.19\">Jos 4:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:15\" href=\"/Joshua.18.15\">18:15</a>, camp <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:1\" href=\"/Numbers.11.1\">Nu 11:1</a> (JE); especially to one approaching <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:17\" href=\"/Judges.7.17\">Ju 7:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:19\" href=\"/Judges.7.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.5\">2 K 7:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.8\">8</a>, so of armed force <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:11\" href=\"/Judges.7.11\">Ju 7:11</a>, people <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:41\" href=\"/Numbers.22.41\">Nu 22:41</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:13\" href=\"/Numbers.23.13\">23:13</a> (JE; emphat. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶפֶם ק׳</span>, opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">כֻּלּוֹ</span>), mt. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:12\" href=\"/Exodus.19.12\">Ex 19:12</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:16\" href=\"/Joshua.18.16\">Jos 18:16</a> (JE); see also <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:8\" href=\"/Joshua.3.8\">3:8</a> (D), v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:15\" href=\"/Joshua.3.15\">15</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:20\" href=\"/Exodus.13.20\">Ex 13:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:6\" href=\"/Numbers.33.6\">Nu 33:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:35\" href=\"/Exodus.16.35\">Ex 16:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:37\" href=\"/Numbers.33.37\">Nu 33:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:27\" href=\"/Joshua.13.27\">Jos 13:27</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:7\" href=\"/Ruth.3.7\">Ru 3:7</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"condensed term for what is included within extremities, = the whole: <span dir=\"rtl\">מִק׳ אֶחָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:2\" href=\"/Genesis.47.2\">Gn 47:2</a> (J), cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.2\">Ez 33:2</a>; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקָּצֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:4\" href=\"/Genesis.19.4\">Gn 19:4</a> (J) = in (its) entirety; = on all sides, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.31\">Je 51:31</a> + <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.26\">50:26</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִקָּצֶה</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקֵּץ</span>, Gie); so <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקָּצֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.11\">Is 56:11</a> Di, but om. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקּ׳</span> 𝔊 Du Che Marti."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְצֵה</span> <em>at the end of</em> a certain time <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:16\" href=\"/Joshua.9.16\">Jos 9:16</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.8\">2 S 24:8</a> + 8 times."}],"num":"4."}]},"rid":"BDB08896","strong_numbers":["7097"],"next_hw":"קָצָה²","prev_hw":"קָצָה","occurrences":"92","quotes":[],"GK":["7895"],"TWOT":["2053a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs